	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Side-emitting smart LED, WS2812B-4020-V6.  Not a drop-in for the plain WS2812B-4020: the feet are 0.65/0.60/0.35/0.65mm wide at -1.675/-0.425/+0.600/+1.675 where that drawing has four 0.41mm feet on a 0.85 pitch, and pin 1 is at the other end.  Pads are 0.25mm wider than their feet; the older land pattern gave a 0.42mm pad for a 0.41mm foot and so no side fillet at all.  Geometry from EasyEDA's terminal and body layers, checked against the LCSC datasheet.  The 3D model is the plain -4020's, turned 180 degrees to fit: approximate, since EasyEDA has none for this revision.")
